    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The original\u00a0<strong><i>FACE LOVE</i></strong> has been given a <i><u>face lift</u></i>\u00a0with new features and  customers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your creations to the <strong>Face Library</strong>, then take them into the brand-new <strong>Creative Mode</strong> to edit them further: with custom names, face and body colors, and your choice of <strong>over\u00a0200+ face stickers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, you can <strong>save high quality images</strong> of your creations to share with friends!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>New Recruit!</i> It's time to get Mug-Making and keep the face factory afloat in <strong><i>FACE LOVE: Face Designer! </i></strong>Take a shift at the Face Tec factory, using strangers' Love Profiles' as inspiration to make them brand new faces.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/6b93d0ede0b5e5d34c60b545345e1fe6.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/88d6da4a1c52a56b1bac492fd9be9470.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/627d8e41bdf8e87f299c333cc8ed8233.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>new selection of customers and face parts</strong> each time you play! Get creative and work with the parts you're given to complement the customer's personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/e8a8f927234244be83259297020030f3.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save <strong>high quality images</strong> of your customers in <strong>Photo Mode</strong>. Choose from a selection of backgrounds to find one that matches your customer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/6f6599caddd6fb13e6b451aad6af0fed.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brand new ways to customize your saved faces, with the <strong>Renamer</strong> tool, <strong>body and head recoloring</strong>, and a gallery of <strong><u>over 200+ face parts</u></strong>. Make a brand new face, or improve an existing customer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/73121562eb5f69c17e91bb03259ab341.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All your faces from Play Mode and Creative Modes are saved to the Library. Browse your creations, or  return and edit   them further!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>C'mon recruit, there's money to be made!!!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/88d6da4a1c52a56b1bac492fd9be9470.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/e18e3c6e7a7037853067ecdc0474d9e2.avif?t=1745599965\" width=616 height=102 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LimboLane is a creative duo making silly games that squish and bounce, comprised of designer Day Lane and animator Yugo Limbo. They have a love for the kitschy, the surreal, and the utterly bizarre. They're known for the nod-and-shake puzzle game <u><i><strong>Smile For Me</strong></i></u> and the a-pocky-lips stopping adventure <u><i><strong>Great God Grove</strong></i></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/ca30dad62c44b7772229ed0ed95c7c8b.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/88d6da4a1c52a56b1bac492fd9be9470.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>New Recruit!</i> It's time to get Mug-Making and keep the face factory afloat in <strong><i>FACE LOVE: Face Designer! </i></strong>Take a shift at the Face Tec factory, using strangers' Love Profiles' as inspiration to make them brand new faces.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/6b93d0ede0b5e5d34c60b545345e1fe6.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/88d6da4a1c52a56b1bac492fd9be9470.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/627d8e41bdf8e87f299c333cc8ed8233.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>new selection of customers and face parts</strong> each time you play! Get creative and work with the parts you're given to complement the customer's personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/e8a8f927234244be83259297020030f3.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save <strong>high quality images</strong> of your customers in <strong>Photo Mode</strong>. Choose from a selection of backgrounds to find one that matches your customer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/6f6599caddd6fb13e6b451aad6af0fed.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brand new ways to customize your saved faces, with the <strong>Renamer</strong> tool, <strong>body and head recoloring</strong>, and a gallery of <strong><u>over 200+ face parts</u></strong>. Make a brand new face, or improve an existing customer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/73121562eb5f69c17e91bb03259ab341.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All your faces from Play Mode and Creative Modes are saved to the Library. Browse your creations, or  return and edit   them further!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>C'mon recruit, there's money to be made!!!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/88d6da4a1c52a56b1bac492fd9be9470.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/e18e3c6e7a7037853067ecdc0474d9e2.avif?t=1745599965\" width=616 height=102 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LimboLane is a creative duo making silly games that squish and bounce, comprised of designer Day Lane and animator Yugo Limbo. They have a love for the kitschy, the surreal, and the utterly bizarre. They're known for the nod-and-shake puzzle game <u><i><strong>Smile For Me</strong></i></u> and the a-pocky-lips stopping adventure <u><i><strong>Great God Grove</strong></i></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/ca30dad62c44b7772229ed0ed95c7c8b.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401050/extras/88d6da4a1c52a56b1bac492fd9be9470.avif?t=1745599965\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span></p>",
